{"id":"3f949e33e8c248ea747e7df8e508056b5a6dbc19","axis":"silent","repo":"rails/rails","sha":"3f949e33e8c248ea747e7df8e508056b5a6dbc19","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"activerecord/CHANGELOG.md","lines":["@@ -1,3 +1,11 @@","+*   Make `db:schema:load` work with MySQL client 9.4 and later.","+","+    From 9.4.0 on, the client by default passes the `SOURCE` command to the","+    server as SQL instead of handling it itself, and the server rejects it with a","+    syntax error. The SQL structure file is now read from standard input instead.","+","+    *Yasuo Honda*","+"," *   Drop the explicit `SET FOREIGN_KEY_CHECKS` statements from MySQL `db:schema:load`."," ","     Dumps written by `mysqldump` since MySQL 4.1.1 and by `mariadb-dump` since"],"additions":8,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"activerecord/lib/active_record/tasks/abstract_tasks.rb","lines":["@@ -53,12 +53,15 @@ def configuration_hash_without_database","         end"," ","         def run_cmd(cmd, *args, **opts)","-          fail run_cmd_error(cmd, args) unless Kernel.system(cmd, *args, opts)","+          fail run_cmd_error(cmd, args, opts) unless Kernel.system(cmd, *args, opts)","         end"," ","-        def run_cmd_error(cmd, args)","+        def run_cmd_error(cmd, args, opts = {})","           msg = +\"failed to execute:\\n\"","-          msg << \"#{cmd} #{filter_sensitive_args(args).join(' ')}\\n\\n\"","+          msg << \"#{cmd} #{filter_sensitive_args(args).join(' ')}\"","+          msg << \" < #{opts[:in]}\" if opts[:in]","+          msg << \" > #{opts[:out]}\" if opts[:out]","+          msg << \"\\n\\n\"","           msg << \"Please check the output above for any errors and make sure that `#{cmd}` is installed in your PATH and has proper permissions.\\n\\n\"","           msg","         end"],"additions":6,"deletions":3,"truncated":false},{"path":"activerecord/lib/active_record/tasks/mysql_database_tasks.rb","lines":["@@ -45,11 +45,10 @@ def structure_dump(filename, extra_flags)"," ","       def